}}The '''Green Dragon Imp''' was acquired as part of the [[Online:Dragon Rise|Dragon Rise]] Event, when 38% of players who owned [[Online:Elsweyr|Elsweyr]] completed the [[Online:Northern Elsweyr Pathfinder|Northern Elsweyr Pathfinder]] [[Online:Achievements|Achievement]]. It was later added to the Seasonal wares of the [[ON:Gold Coast Bazaar|Gold Coast Bazaar]] for {{ESO TB|750}} between April 2, 2026 to July 8, 2026.

Its default name is "Pookdovah", which means "Stink Dragon" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|Dragon Language]].
